      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-207",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccot } x) \t=  -\\dfrac 1 {1+x^2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\,\\text{arccot\u00a0}x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot\u00a0}x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-207.json",
          "file_sha256": "a95aa089ac7f7c435677de3a068e647b792b55e6a38077fb3bc6bf8ecb07a434"
